    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Big guns, big guns, what you got, huh?",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Slatt, slatt and pop back at the opps, huh?",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Gang this, oh, you gang that?",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Don't let 'em know that you regret how you became that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "A good kid, fine home, mom and dad in the pic'",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "A little middle-class money, every Christmas legit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Family trips, Ivy-bound, and one day, hit the switch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "You ain't wanna be seen as a bitch, cuz",
          "rhyme": "y",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "And none them face tats gon' hide the fact that you sad, bruh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "You ain't a thug, you was in drama club, you's a actor",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "But now cuz gettin' validation from the dumb and confused (Ayy, blood)",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Now you facin' five to ten 'cause you had somethin' to prove, let's talk about it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABBCDEFAGHI",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABBCCCDAEFC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Preacher man, preacher man, preach (Woo)",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You make these folks think you got somethin' to teach, like you ain't lyin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Big bank from them collections, well, what you buyin'?",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Ain't too fond of them gays, you don't deny it, wait",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Since a kid, you knew somethin' was up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Had you thinkin' God would hate you so you covered it up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Gotta hide how you live, what you really enjoy",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "So got a wife, got a kid, but you be fuckin' them boys",
          "rhyme": "Oj",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Sick of all the shame, sick of all the pain that's within",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Scared of bein' seen, tired of rebukin' the sin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Trade it all to be free and shine bright like the sun",
          "rhyme": "un",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "But you back on that religious shit as soon as you cum, let's talk about it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABBCDDAEBFGH",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABBCDDAEBFGB"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_5",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Big-ass house that's on the hill (Hill)",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Big-ass wheels in the garage ('Rage, hope you find yourself)",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Three cute kids that's in your arms",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Your husband just made another mil'",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You want your life back and a massage (Oh, oh)",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Tired of bein' at home, personality gone (Nah)",
          "rhyme": "on",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Body ain't been the same, postpartum is long, your identity gone",
          "rhyme": "on",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Mama your first name, the last one got changed",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "They dream about your nest but you crave flyin' alone, mane  (Oh)",
          "rhyme": "an",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "You would start all over if we keepin' it real",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Current life is full but you ain't feelin' fulfilled",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Fantasize about the dreams you left on the shelf",
          "rhyme": "Elf",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Can't even get alone time to think of killin' yourself, let's talk about it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCABDDEFAGHI",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCABDDEBAFFA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_7",
      "type": "interlude",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Keep that shit one hundred with you, with yourself",
          "rhyme": "Elf",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You don't have to put on no costume",
          "rhyme": "ym",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You don't ever have to lie to kick it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_8",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Yeah, tool won't stay hard, pain in your chest",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Hair fallin' out, won't blame it on the stress",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Claim it's new partners, blame it on your ex",
          "rhyme": "Eks",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Chest claim it's reflex, try to blame it on the cook",
          "rhyme": "uk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Look, boy, keep runnin', you'll be crampin' in your foot",
          "rhyme": "ut",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Nervous, then you notice ain't no service on the hook",
          "rhyme": "uk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Paranoid since nineteen, nervous system shook",
          "rhyme": "uk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Better sit the fuck down or that skull gettin' took",
          "rhyme": "uk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "That's ten million dollars invested, no justifyin' that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Tryna sell them weird-ass clothes, nobody buyin' that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Sentiment is right, but your audience isn't racked enough",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "That shit is a failure, my nigga, go 'head and pack it up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "And put it in the trunk, you talk a lot of shit to not even be number one (No)",
          "rhyme": "On",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Your beats ain't placin', them songs ain't slappin', your raps ain't rankin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Your stage presence don't even be in they conversation, go home",
          "rhyme": "om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "You ain't gotta hide from the truth",
          "rhyme": "yt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Tell your family why you such a recluse",
          "rhyme": "yz",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Tell your spirit why you feelin' it's a wrap in the booth",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Dog, how dare you try to ruin her marriage? (Come on)",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Claim you never wore a mask and how you don't get embarrassed",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Boy, you selfish as fuck, that's really why you scared of bein' a parent",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Boy, that therapy needed, I'd dare you to seek it, but I'd lose a bet",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Your respect won't get given 'til we postin' your death",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "It's clear you wish you got your flowers sent",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "You eatin' fertilizer to balance shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Now go and stand in the sun, and use them fake tears to water your roots",
          "rhyme": "uts",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Take that mask off and tell 'em the truth, let's talk about it, nigga",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEDDDFFGHIJKLMNOPQRSQTUF",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAABBBBBCCDEDFGHHGCIJACJKBC"
    }
